column154:
12/Jun/17 10:19 PM;557058:443ab871-4096-403e-bd6f-f3534fe417f0;Pasting information regarding the collection bug over from the #ao3-adt Slack channel...

*Sarken [22:33]*
For the Rails 4.2 collection bug, the problem appears to be {{work.approved_collections}} in the {{show_collections_data(work)}} method no longer returns the collections the work is in... it now returns all the items in the collection.

{code:java}
  def show_collections_data(work)
    collections = work.approved_collections
    collections.collect {|coll| link_to coll.title, collection_path(coll)}.join(ArchiveConfig.DELIMITER_FOR_OUTPUT).html_safe
  end
{code}

{{approved_collections}} used to be this:

{code:java}
   has_many :approved_collections, :through => :collection_items, :source => :collection,
     :conditions => ['collection_items.user_approval_status = ? AND collection_items.collection_approval_status = ?', CollectionItem::APPROVED, CollectionItem::APPROVED]
{code}

And is now this:

{code:java}
  has_many :approved_collections, -> {
    where('collection_items.user_approval_status = ? AND collection_items.collection_approval_status = ?', CollectionItem::APPROVED, CollectionItem::APPROVED)
   }, through: :collection_items, source: :collection
{code}

*Sarken [22:42]*
I can make it work by changing {{show_collections_data(work)}} to this:

{code:java}
  def show_collections_data(work)
    collection_items = work.collection_items.where(user_approval_status: CollectionItem::APPROVED, collection_approval_status: CollectionItem::APPROVED)
    collections = collection_items.collect { |item| Collection.find(item.collection_id) }
    collections.collect { |coll| link_to coll.title, collection_path(coll) }.join(ArchiveConfig.DELIMITER_FOR_OUTPUT).html_safe
  end
{code}

But a better solution would really be making {{approved_collections}} behave the way it used to...

*Sarken [22:59]*
There were also changes to {{approved_collections}} in lib/collectible.rb: https://github.com/otwcode/otwarchive/pull/2917/files#diff-356553a9c4dce50f3565e0e424e170a5

