column27:
Tags created after September 1, 2018, are not appearing in the mass wrangling bins. [Here is the fandom bin sorted by date, newest at the top.|https://archiveofourown.org/tag_wranglings?show=fandoms&sort_column=created_at&sort_direction=DESC].

This may or may not be reproducible on staging.

It's possible the taggings_count_cache, which is used in the [in_use scope|https://github.com/otwcode/otwarchive/blob/f5d1fac3a815472ae5c3346450c46eb55fd3b46c/app/models/tag.rb#L266], is not updating.

When we look for unwrangled fandoms using the in_use scope, [as we do in tag wrangling controller|https://github.com/otwcode/otwarchive/blob/f5d1fac3a815472ae5c3346450c46eb55fd3b46c/app/controllers/tag_wranglings_controller.rb#L25], we get the last tag that appears on the fandoms mass bin:
{{2.3.0 :001 > Fandom.unwrangled.in_use.order("created_at DESC").first}}
{{=> \#<Fandom id: 25838802, name: "The Angel's Game", canonical: false, created_at: "2018-09-01 23:14:47", updated_at: "2018-09-01 23:14:47", taggings_count_cache: 1, adult: false, type: "Fandom", merger_id: nil, delta: false, last_wrangler_id: 4491570, last_wrangler_type: "User", unwrangleable: false, sortable_name: "Angel's Game">}}

When we don't scope it to only tags in use, we get a more recent tag that is missing from the bin:
{{2.3.0 :002 > Fandom.unwrangled.order("created_at DESC").first}}
{{=> \#<Fandom id: 25944792, name: "かぼちゃワイン", canonical: false, created_at: "2018-09-06 05:10:35", updated_at: "2018-09-06 05:10:35", taggings_count_cache: 0, adult: false, type: "Fandom", merger_id: nil, delta: false, last_wrangler_id: 3356928, last_wrangler_type: "User", unwrangleable: false, sortable_name: "かぼちゃワイン">}}

Note that this problem does not correspond with a deploy date – the previous deploy (release 0.9.220) was August 27.

