In other works, the spam alert email is failing to be sent because the user has been deleted between the email being generated and being sent.

That's annoying because Policy & Abuse isn't getting the email, but it also is cluttering up the Resque error list and making it annoyingly difficult to find bigger issues.

Since the email lists spam scores by user ("User \[linked username\] has a score of \[score\]"), it probably makes sense to skip over users that have been deleted.

h1. Testing
I'd recommend deploying to production and checking if any more errors appear in Resque.

