Users get logged out (of only the current session) when requesting a password reset
{quote}

With the switch to Devise::Recoverable (https://github.com/otwcode/otwarchive/pull/3489), requesting a password reset (without actually changing the password after) won't affect any session, since we have by default:
{code:ruby}
config.sign_in_after_reset_password = true
{code}

