h1. Steps to reproduce

# Log in
# Hi, username\! > My Dashboard > Skins > Create Site Skin (or a work skin, but the site skin option is right there, so let’s go with that)
# Enter a title
# Enter some CSS that uses the quotes property, e.g. {{q \{ quotes: '\\00AB' '\\00BB' }}}
# Press Submit

h1. What happens

You get the following error:

{color:#ff5630}Sorry\! We couldn't save this skin because:{color}

* {color:#ff5630}The quotes property in q cannot have the value '\\00AB' '\\00BB', sorry\!{color}
* {color:#ff5630}There don't seem to be any rules for q{color}

h1. What should happen

You should be able to use the property [as god and the W3C intended|https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/quotes].

