*What should happen*
We should replace large values with a max limit and return a "No results found" page, instead of having these errors show up in monitoring tools. Word counts are stored in a MySQL int column, so a limit of 2 billion should suffice for now.

Note that this error can happen with all formats of word count ranges (N, >N, <N, N1-N2), and also in the "From"/"To" word count fields in listings' filters.

